Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:05.44,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,VR京都 欢迎你们的到来
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.44,0:00:10.34,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,古老的四神 青龙 朱雀 白虎 玄武
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.34,0:00:12.88,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,拱卫着京都的这四个据点
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.88,0:00:18.20,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,再加上位于京城中心的高塔 从暗之眷属的攻势中守下它们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:23.25,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,将其命名为 京都塔防游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:30.13,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我将会打倒你们 得到所有的点数
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:33.57,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:36.56,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,把全世界关于我丑态的记忆…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:44.54,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,把全世界关于我丑态的记忆全部删除
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:46.94,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,再重新获得世人的欢迎
Comment: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:49.69,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,(吞噬之星, Eating Star)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:49.69,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,吞噬之星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:49.69,Ruby,Eita,0,0,0,,{\fs46\pos(960,992)} Eating Star
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.96,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,是这么回事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:55.36,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,本来就差不多算是人渣中的人渣了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:57.71,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,终于彻底疯掉了啊 瑛太
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:00:59.16,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,别叫我那个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:00.95,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我是风之战士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.95,0:01:02.58,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,毕宿五
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:05.70,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:07.88,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,是从风之邪神的哈斯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:11.41,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,再加上金牛座的亮星毕宿五想出来的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:12.86,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,是 是的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:16.80,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,就是初中生会热衷的那种 那个什么 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.14,0:01:18.14,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,好土
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.35,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,连让人尴尬的部分也走向极端了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:23.57,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.69,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.82,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,请听一下规则
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:34.78,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,东西南北四个据点组成了保护着京都塔的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:39.04,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,在被结界保护着的时候 塔是不会被攻击的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:45.50,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,反过来说如果四个据点全部陷落了 那京都塔就会变得毫无防备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:47.32,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,正是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:49.32,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,游戏时间是60分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:53.64,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,如果能守住京都塔 那就算是各位取得胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:57.44,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你算什么战士啊 瑛太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.81,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你只不过是个自私的人渣罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:02.81,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我一定要首先把你干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:06.31,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,话说灵子 我们可没有时间能浪费在这种人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:07.31,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:09.60,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你哪知道了 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:15.09,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你就是这种不听人话的地方让我火大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:17.32,DefaultTop,Miko,0,0,0,,你说我什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:18.07,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,现在可不是争吵的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:20.08,DefaultTop,Kanna,0,0,0,,你这家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:20.08,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,大家冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:25.67,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,真是的 大家要好好相处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:31.76,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,人类这种生物为什么会这么热爱争斗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:12.10,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,这次是塔防游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:14.40,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,如果所有人抱团的话会来不及防守的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:16.18,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:18.07,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,让我们各自散开 分头行动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:26.76,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,菜刀？好土
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:29.04,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,也行 我就这么上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:32.13,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,为什么只有我拿到的是这种搞笑的玩具锤子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.89,0:04:35.24,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,灵子 东边的据点没人防守
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:36.45,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你去那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:37.51,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:41.84,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,灵子正在前往东边的青龙门啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.30,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,好 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:47.77,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,首先是第一波
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:58.82,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,那么 苏醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.75,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,第一波
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:13.69,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:19.91,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,生鱼片三枚斩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:26.61,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:30.68,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,控制不好力度真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:34.75,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,装填
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:37.55,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,瞄准
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:39.72,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,射击
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:44.82,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,防卫完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:48.58,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这游戏其实很轻松嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:51.70,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你又在随口乱说话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:54.27,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,难搞的只有瑛太那家伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:55.66,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:57.13,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,必须时刻提防
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:06:01.21,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那家伙 真的打算背叛人类吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:04.43,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,真不愧是瑛太小哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:08.13,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,是打算在开局时先给对手尝些甜头吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:12.21,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,真让人火大 想催人干活的话就说得更直白点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:14.64,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,真可怕真可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.13,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,不过 你到底打算怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.27,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,你可得抓紧时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:24.10,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我只会为了我自己而行动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:25.62,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,不过你们就放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:27.95,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我会帮你们赢下游戏的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:31.79,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,我只会为了我自己而行动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:35.49,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,太棒了 小瑛太
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.49,0:06:37.97,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,不愧是我选上的眷属
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.97,0:06:40.95,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,对自己的信条绝无一丝的动摇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.95,0:06:42.80,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,简直可以称为究极的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:44.22,Default,Zhar,0,0,0,,认同需求
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.51,Default,Lloigor,0,0,0,,自我表现欲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:47.22,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:50.02,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,如此忠实于自身的欲求
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:55.23,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,和自我保全的渣...人类实在是相当罕见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.54,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,格亚 就是现在 出动那群家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:04.90,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:07.70,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,第二波
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:11.78,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,这下情况就有点麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:18.65,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,不愧是职业玩家瑛..哦不对毕宿五
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:20.92,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,是在熟知武器相性基础上走出的妙手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:23.88,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,清司郎 我这就去你那边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:37.60,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,这样好吗？擅自离开自己的岗位
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:40.44,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,滚开 清司郎现在很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:45.93,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,那就被我干掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.45,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:54.41,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你这个自我中心的阴湿混账
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.91,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,要说自我中心 你不也是一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:08:01.19,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,承认吧  你和我其实根本就是同一类人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.67,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:12.27,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,哎呀 这个时候居然出现了随机武器箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.72,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,道歉告示牌？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:19.10,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,现在 据点剩下的耐久度可不多了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.82,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,圭小姐 为什么到这边来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:32.65,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,我之后再解释
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.12,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.57,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我会保护好你的背后的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:46.49,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,让我们两个人死守这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.21,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:49.84,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,好啊好啊 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:52.47,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,我就是想要这种镜头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:56.66,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这种能燃起来的剧情余也不讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:06.53,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,这便是编写出感动的程式
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:11.64,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,用尽一切方法促成绝望与希望的协同 这便是我们的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:14.11,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,努力 友情 胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:17.57,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,就让我把这些词汇赠予各位吧 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:21.90,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,那就让我出下一招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:30.09,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这个时候第三波攻势出动了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.88,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,对无人防守的东西两个据点进行突袭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:37.55,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,耐久值正在被不断削减
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:41.57,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,那么 你们要怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.17,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,很不甘心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:50.22,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,没办法前去帮助伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.74,0:09:55.45,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,甚至我们还能继续发动下一波攻势
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:10:01.45,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,就是这样 这边也再加上一些附赠的小礼品啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.89,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,接下来是第四波
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:07.42,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,向朱雀和玄武两个据点都投入了新的部队
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.83,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,没听说有这么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:11.71,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,一如既往地藏了一大堆附加规则呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.51,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那还真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:17.51,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,但是你看 塔防游戏不就是这样的东西嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:20.22,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,你们对游戏的理解也太随便了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:22.16,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我有一个重要的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:23.43,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.43,0:10:26.35,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,为什么这次特地选择了京都作为舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:29.32,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这当然是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:31.28,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,说到京都那便是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:33.15,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,不会是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:36.16,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,京都塔——⠀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:37.43,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,京都塔防　⠀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.95,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,居然是冷笑话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:43.16,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,就因为冷笑话搞出了这么可怕的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.30,Default,Zhar,0,0,0,,好烂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:44.93,Default,Lloigor,0,0,0,,好烂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:46.66,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,不 太棒了 太棒了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:50.84,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,简直是搞笑界的技术奇点 从中感到了深不见底的狂气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.24,0:10:55.86,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的超现实短剧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.86,0:10:57.30,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,虽然我不是很懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:11:00.01,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,还剩三十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:02.78,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这就是京都塔防游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:06.65,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,每个据点都危在旦夕 战况胶着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:10.65,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,猎户座的力量啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:14.15,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,灵子！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:17.99,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,如果我们三个都倒下了的话 你懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:20.07,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,嗯 交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:27.13,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,真是场不错的对局啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:43.47,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:52.77,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我说过的吧？ 要最优先击溃你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:58.53,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,很快所有据点都将陷落 保护塔的结界会失效
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:03.45,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,等待你的将是毁灭…我的刀刃已无法阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:04.54,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,放弃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:08.26,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,叽里咕噜地说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:11.42,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.88,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:23.64,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,你还真是不走运啊 灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:27.32,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,舞动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:29.19,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,世界末日！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:34.52,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,坠落吧！ 坠落吧！ 坠落吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:40.86,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,只有这种程度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:44.07,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这种程度可还没法结束啊 你这人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:46.65,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:54.67,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,这不是挺走运的嘛 灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:57.17,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,还挺能坚持的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:13:01.09,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,但是到这里就该是极限了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:08.16,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:11.14,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,不会是迷之圆盘…UFO吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.40,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,祂要用那个攻击塔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:17.73,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,怎么能在这种地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.21,0:13:29.30,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:42.66,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,圭姐？ 清司郎先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:45.50,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,诶呀！ 朱雀也陷落了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:49.22,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这下保卫京都塔的结界就全部消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:51.98,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那么现在进入最终的战局
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.19,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,眷族开始向塔进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:58.00,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,此外 BOSS单位也要开始攻击了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:03.40,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,很好 要结束了 要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.32,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:08.41,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,灵子！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:10.29,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,啊～真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:23.09,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,就算现在爆出这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:24.92,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,也来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:39.02,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,别怨我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:42.71,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,好像已经没人能来救你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:44.61,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,结束这局游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:47.20,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,好了 再见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:07.30,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,还有 一分钟…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:11.85,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,交给你了…灵子…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:15.48,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,如此蝼蚁竟然胆敢阻挠我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.11,0:15:19.44,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,我就该好好杀掉那个女人才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:28.03,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,这次是真的…结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:30.49,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,怎么可能让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.49,0:15:32.16,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,灵子！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:34.01,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,烦死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:38.05,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,别因为自己没有朋友就对其他人怀恨在心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.73,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,啰嗦！ 下去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:59.96,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,真是最棒的落幕啊 灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:29.13,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,既然是在京都的街上 我就算瞎了也能到达任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:33.18,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,神奈？ 但你到底怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:44.90,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我有摩托车驾驶证的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.15,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,驾驶证？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:50.11,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,不 比起这个 难道你是骑着摩托抄近路的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:53.32,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,居然抄了近路？ 为什么你做得到…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:58.08,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,把这里选作游戏的舞台 算是你们的运气到头了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:03.46,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,你 你你你什么意思神乐坂神奈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:05.63,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,难道 难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:12.26,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,京都是在母亲再婚之前 我出生并在此长大的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:14.22,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这里是我真正的故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:21.35,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,时间到——！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.70,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,等等等 等下等下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:26.36,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,刚刚的话太突然了 我没反应过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:30.01,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,格亚姐 这一局可真个儿遗憾咯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:31.57,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,嘀嗒…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:35.32,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,你早就知道了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.79,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,当然 毕竟我是运营
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:45.03,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,算了 就夸奖你们一番吧 人类
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:46.96,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,还在嘴硬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:50.87,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,真是让人作呕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:56.22,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,恭喜！ 保卫京都塔成功！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:59.14,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,是各位玩家的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:06.24,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.78,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你怎么那么乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:14.53,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你要是发疯死掉了 我可就没法给你做饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:17.62,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那算什么？感觉有点恶心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:22.25,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,真是的 我是说那就没法再跟你吵架了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:27.88,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,为什么我会为这种家伙这么努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:29.34,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:30.92,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.39,0:18:33.63,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:39.75,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,话说 刚才的京都腔是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:44.35,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这里是我的老家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:50.20,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,虽然我从小就受尽了家人之苦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.57,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,但只有祖母
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.07,0:18:59.33,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,只有祖母会对我温柔相待
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:09.88,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,所以京都对我来说\N是唯一存放有和家人美好回忆的重要地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:11.88,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:24.35,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,啊～真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:28.90,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,诶呀 真好啊小神奈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:31.87,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,这下肯定能赚不少收视率
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:34.28,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,真是完美的展开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:36.40,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,接下来的气氛也一定会无比热烈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:39.45,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,哈斯塔 你有点太没底线了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:42.28,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,邪神哪有什么底线
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:43.51,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,展开？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:44.78,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,接下来？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:46.33,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,没底线？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:48.42,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,感觉话里有话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:51.29,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,又有什么不好的事瞒着我们吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:20:02.18,Default,Newscaster,0,0,0,,现在21时 京都市区多座建筑\N受到了不明原因的大规模破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:05.59,Default,Newscaster,0,0,0,,政府发布了紧急事态通报
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.59,0:20:10.66,Default,Newscaster,0,0,0,,可能是由于灾难或恐怖主义…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:09.31,DefaultTop,Kei,0,0,0,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:14.19,DefaultTop,Seishiro,0,0,0,,难道和我们进行的游戏 影响到了现实世界？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:22.41,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,报酬越多 游戏的惩罚当然越大
Comment: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:24.74,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,(风浪越大鱼越贵, High risk, hign return)嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:24.74,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,风浪越大鱼越贵嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:24.74,Ruby,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,{\fs46\pos(926,992)} High risk, hign return
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:28.96,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,你就是为了这个才去实地考察的吗 格亚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:30.67,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:34.67,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,我说过的吧？ 不过是在和蚂蚁玩耍罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:40.97,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,再说 举办这个大型游戏也是为了各位着想哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:44.72,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,灵子小姐 你需要整整十亿点吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.85,0:20:50.94,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,想要的报酬越高 自然风险也就越大 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:21:00.20,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,都做了…什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:05.62,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,混蛋 你们到底要愚弄人类到什么地步！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:15.17,Default,Man,0,0,0,,真的假的这个 原来不是演的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:28.85,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,哎呀 真是有如三头六臂一般的活跃表现啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:31.39,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,就连佛祖也会为之惊叹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.39,0:21:34.40,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,嗯 你可以尽管相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:35.24,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,这样的话 我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:41.61,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,但是 也请你支付败北的代价吧 毕宿五
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:47.57,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这也是根据你最喜欢的 游戏规则来实行的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.80,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,乖哦乖乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:08.81,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,那么那么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.93,0:22:12.06,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,这是终结的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:14.64,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,还是开始的终结
